# LOOM-8 demo: UK garage (2-step), 132 BPM swung, C minor. (tools/demos/render.sh renders it; its bank is
# build/demos/garage.bin: a sung bar made by tools/demos/make_banks.py and the sesame break, private.)
#   T1 kit: the 2-step (the kick on 1 and the "and" of 3, clap and snare on 2 and 4, shuffled hats and shaker)
#   T2 weft "denim bass": the bouncing bass, glides by the portamento trick
#   T3 organ "reed combo": the stabs     T4 slice: the sung bar in 16, re-cut and pitch-locked (the chops)
#   T5 slice: the sesame break, high-passed, as a top loop   T6 voile "voile choir": the pad, sung
#   T7 voile "doo wop": a vocal answer at the end of each bar in the hooks and the breakdown
# The groove: swing, every pattern at 50. Song: intro 4 (pad, the voice through a closed filter, hats), groove 8,
# hook 8 (the voice whole), breakdown 4 (the chops, the sub held), hook 2 8 (chops pitched, the kit busier),
# outro 2 (an echo throw on the voice).
master 4096
samples build/demos/garage.bin
bpm 132
groove swing

# ---- the sounds (UK garage: crisp and skippy. The kit short and bright, shuffled hats and shaker up front, a
# bouncing weft bass, the organ stabs short, the voice chopped and
# pitched up through a moving filter and a dotted echo; a medium room; the master clean)
# T1 the kit: a short punchy kick, a snare pitched up and cut short, a tight clap, hats between closed and open
knob 1 d1.k1 86
knob 1 d1.k2 42
knob 1 d1.k3 76
knob 1 d1.k4 88
knob 1 d2.k1 100
knob 1 d2.k2 26
knob 1 d2.k3 100
knob 1 d2.volume 70
knob 1 d5.k1 112
knob 1 d5.k2 40
knob 1 d5.volume 78
knob 1 d3.k1 102
knob 1 d3.k2 30
knob 1 d3.k4 44
knob 1 d3.volume 70
knob 1 d4.k1 102
knob 1 d4.k2 56
knob 1 d4.k4 44
knob 1 d4.volume 62
knob 1 d9.k1 70
knob 1 d9.volume 62
knob 1 d8.volume 70
knob 1 ftype dynamic
knob 1 cut 10
knob 1 res 46
knob 1 fenv 24
knob 1 level 89
knob 1 send2 12
# T2 weft "denim bass": the bouncing bass, glides by the portamento trick (as the earlier mix had it: the user's pick)
preset 2 round_sub knit
# (the song was written before a bass preset sat an octave down)
param 2 oct 2
knob 2 brain no
knob 2 porta 30
knob 2 level 102
# T3 organ "reed combo": the stabs, short
preset 3 combo bellows
knob 3 brain no
knob 3 d 62
knob 3 s 40
knob 3 r 24
knob 3 level 93
knob 3 send1 24
knob 3 send2 18
# T4 the sung bar in 16, re-cut: brightened, a resonant low-pass moved by a slow LFO, the echo and the room
knob 4 engine slice
preset 4 jungle slice
knob 4 e1 u1
knob 4 e4 127
knob 4 vmode poly
knob 4 cut 127
knob 4 res 46
knob 4 ltype wave
knob 4 lspeed 2
knob 4 lamt 40
knob 4 ldest filter
knob 4 ctype tilt
knob 4 camt 70
knob 4 ctone 100
knob 4 brain no
knob 4 level 101
knob 4 send1 36
knob 4 send2 30
# T5 the sesame break, high-passed: the top loop
knob 5 engine slice
preset 5 jungle slice
knob 5 e1 u2
knob 5 e4 127
knob 5 ftype hp12
knob 5 cut 84
knob 5 brain no
knob 5 level 101
# T6 voile "voile choir": the pad, back
preset 6 ooh_choir voile
knob 6 brain no
knob 6 level 89
knob 6 send2 40
# T7 voile "doo wop": the answer at each bar's end
preset 7 vocal_chop voile
knob 7 brain no
knob 7 level 75
knob 7 send1 40
knob 7 send2 30
# FX I a dotted-eighth echo, its repeats open; FX II "studio M", lifted a little on top
knob 11 engine delay
knob 11 e1 85
knob 11 e3 64
knob 11 e4 84
knob 12 engine studio_M
knob 12 e3 72
# the master: a little air, the compressor light
mst hi 74
mst lo 64
mst comp 56
mst level 106

# ---- T1 the kit: kick 1, snare 2, hat 3, open 4, clap 5, conga 8, shaker 9, fm 11
pat 1 1 16 1 50 50
hits 1 1 1 x.........x.....
hits 1 1 5 ....x.......x...
hits 1 1 2 ....o.......o...
hits 1 1 3 ..x...x.g.x...x.
hits 1 1 9 ggogggogggogggog
hits 1 1 4 ..............o.
hits 1 1 8 .......o..o.....
# P2 busier: a second kick that skips, ghost snares, the open hat moving
pat 1 2 16 1 50 50
hits 1 2 1 x.........x..o..
hits 1 2 5 ....x.......x...
hits 1 2 2 ....o..g....o.g.
hits 1 2 3 ..x...x.g.x.....
hits 1 2 9 ggogggogggogggog
hits 1 2 4 ......o.......o.
hits 1 2 8 .......o..o...o.
chance 1 2 14 1:2
# P3 hats and shaker only
pat 1 3 16 1 50 50
hits 1 3 3 ..x...x...x...x.
hits 1 3 9 g.ogg.ogg.ogg.og

# ---- T2 the bass: Cm | Ab | Fm | G
pat 2 1 64 1 50 50
notes 2 1 1 2 110 C2
notes 2 1 4 0.5 90 C3
notes 2 1 7 1 100 C2
notes 2 1 11 1 100 Bb1
notes 2 1 12 1 105 C2
notes 2 1 15 1 95 Eb2
notes 2 1 17 2 110 Ab1
notes 2 1 20 0.5 90 Ab2
notes 2 1 23 1 100 Ab1
notes 2 1 27 1 100 G1
notes 2 1 28 1 105 Ab1
notes 2 1 31 1 95 Bb1
