notes 2 1 52 0.5 90 G2
notes 2 1 55 1 100 G1
notes 2 1 59 1 100 F1
notes 2 1 60 1 105 G1
notes 2 1 63 1 95 B1
trick 2 1 12 porta 3
trick 2 1 28 porta 3
trick 2 1 44 porta 3
trick 2 1 60 porta 3
trick 2 1 4 porta 2
trick 2 1 20 porta 2
# P2 the breakdown: held roots
pat 2 2 64 1 50 50
notes 2 2 1 15 100 C2
notes 2 2 17 15 100 Ab1
notes 2 2 33 15 100 F1
notes 2 2 49 15 100 G1

