notes 3 1 3 0.5 100 Eb4 G4 D5
notes 3 1 8 0.5 90 Eb4 G4 D5
notes 3 1 11 0.5 95 Eb4 G4 D5
notes 3 1 19 0.5 100 Eb4 G4 C5
notes 3 1 24 0.5 90 Eb4 G4 C5
notes 3 1 27 0.5 95 Eb4 G4 C5
notes 3 1 35 0.5 100 Ab3 C4 G4
notes 3 1 40 0.5 90 Ab3 C4 G4
notes 3 1 43 0.5 95 Ab3 C4 G4
notes 3 1 51 0.5 100 F3 G3 D4
notes 3 1 56 0.5 90 F3 G3 D4
notes 3 1 59 0.5 95 F3 G3 D4
chance 3 1 11 1:2
chance 3 1 27 2:2

