# ---- T6 the pad (the choir)
pat 6 1 64
notes 6 1 1 16 80 C3 G3 D4
notes 6 1 17 16 80 Ab2 Eb3 C4
notes 6 1 33 16 80 F2 C3 Ab3
notes 6 1 49 16 80 G2 D3 B3

# ---- T7 voile's "doo wop": the answer at the end of each bar, swung with the rest
pat 7 1 64 1 50 50
notes 7 1 10 1 100 G4
notes 7 1 11 1 90 Bb4
notes 7 1 13 3 105 C5
notes 7 1 26 1 100 C5
notes 7 1 27 1 90 Bb4
notes 7 1 29 3 105 G4
notes 7 1 42 1 100 Ab4
notes 7 1 43 1 90 G4
notes 7 1 45 3 105 F4
notes 7 1 58 1 100 F4
notes 7 1 59 1 90 D4
notes 7 1 61 3 105 G4
chance 7 1 26 1:2
chance 7 1 27 1:2
chance 7 1 29 1:2

# ---- scenes and the song
scenedef 1 3 1 1 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 1 .xx.x.xx
scenedef 2 1 1 1 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 2 ...x.xxx
scenedef 3 1 1 1 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 3 .....x.x
scenedef 4 3 2 1 2 1 1 1 1
scenemute 4 ..x.x..x
scenedef 5 2 1 1 2 1 1 1 1
scenemute 5 .....x.x
scenedef 6 3 1 1 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 6 .xx.x.xx
song 1:4 2:8 3:8 4:4 5:8 6:2
songloop 0

# ---- play the song (HOME, SELECT to the Song page, PLAY), and perform

knob 4 cut 60
tap HOME
turn SELECT 1
stats reset
wav loom_demo_garage.wav
tap PLAY
bars 1
knob 4 cut 72
bars 1
knob 4 cut 86
bars 1
knob 4 cut 104
bars 1
knob 4 cut 127
# groove 8: the last beat stuttered
bars 7.75
throw stutter on perc
bars 0.25
throw stutter off perc
# hook 8
bars 8
# breakdown 4: the chops; the delay longer
knob 11 e1 92
bars 3.5
throw build on perc
bars 0.5
throw build off perc
knob 11 e1 85
# hook 2, 8
bars 8
# outro 2: the voice echoes away
throw echo on mel 4
bars 2
throw echo off mel 4
wait 2500
wavstop
stats
